# AI worktrees (one per AI, created by the AI-*.bat launchers)
.work/
ai/TASKS.current.md
ai/ROADMAP.current.md
# asset/: renders of the code-drawn art and the gallery index are regenerated
# (ASSETS.bat / npm run art:export, art:gallery); import previews are scratch;
# reference sheets have unknown licences and must never be redistributed.
asset/_export/
asset/_preview/
asset/gallery.json
asset/gallery.js
asset/reference/*
!asset/reference/.gitkeep
!asset/reference/README.md
# agent worktrees (isolated working copies)
.claude/worktrees/
